    "Bc5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Instead of the usual defence, the bishop swings to c5 — the Traxler Counterattack. At first blush it looks absurd, simply leaving the f-pawn hanging, and that's exactly the trap: most players facing it think it's a blunder and grab the pawn.",
   "kind": "plan"
  },
