   "line": [
    "Bxf2+"
   ],
   "spoken": "And that's where it bites — a bishop sacrifice with check on f2. It's a genuine, sound sacrifice that hurls the position into wild complications the moment the bishop is taken. Snatching the pawn walks straight into the storm.",
   "kind": "tactic"
