   "spoken": "The commonly recommended answer is the bishop check on f7 and a retreat — objectively the engine's top line, but not practical. After the rook joins, the defender has real practical compensation: even though the first player is better with perfect play, it's a genuinely frightening position to hold in a fast game.",
