   "line": [
    "d4"
   ],
   "spoken": "The recommendation instead is the quiet central push to d4 — a distant third in popularity and virtually unseen at the top level, which is precisely its first virtue: it's very likely to catch the opponent completely off guard.",
   "kind": "plan",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
