   "line": [
    "d5"
   ],
   "spoken": "And it's not just a surprise — the only saving reply is a counter-thrust to d5, hitting the bishop, which is far from an intuitive move. Miss it and the defender lands immediately in a lost position.",
   "kind": "tactic",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
   "ply": 9,
   "t": 354,
   "fen": "r1bqk2r/pppp1ppp/2n2n2/2b1p1N1/2BPP3/8/PPP2PPP/RNBQK2R b KQkq - 0 5",
