   "spoken": "Here's the crux — without the central pawn move, the main line ends in a draw by perpetual check, the queen relentlessly harrying a king that can't escape. That perpetual is exactly what the extra pawn move is designed to prevent.",
   "kind": "tactic",
   "reanchor": true
