   "line": [
    "Bxf2+",
    "Kxf2"
   ],
   "spoken": "With the pawn move inserted, the defender who follows the memorised main line gets a cold shower — the key perpetual check is simply no longer available, because the freed bishop now guards that square. Down a rook and a piece with no perpetual, the defence collapses, and a queen check followed by a knight capture and rook check crashes through.",
   "kind": "tactic",
   "reanchor": true
  },
